message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper (manuscript in preparation) and this repository. NFHS data: cite IIPS and ICF (see README.md)."
title: "El Niño, local climate and child health in India (NFHS-4 and NFHS-5): code and aggregate data"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hssling/elnino-child-india"
